[{"title":"十四盐","author":"释函是","text":"雪中香色水中盐，夜夜看花味欲兼。\n不是我来寒彻骨，枉教人醉月明帘。\n孤山影碎千丛玉，万里传持一素缣。\n几度因风聊寄赠，恐惊头白易生嫌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45110,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五咸","author":"释函是","text":"满林秀色映松杉，西竺先生经一函。\n雪岭开残迂冻腊，早春疏影到千岩。\n山中有客堪餐石，月下何人曳素衫。\n且抱閒情恣幽赏，香台云外共諵諵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45111,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一东","author":"释函是","text":"叶尽花自发，正当寒山中。\n山寒人见少，花发年年同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45112,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二冬","author":"释函是","text":"花在寒云里，看来隔一重。\n路傍犹落落，况复到高峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45113,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三江","author":"释函是","text":"枯树望空白，回头香在窗。\n一时闻见静，使我梦魂降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45114,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四支","author":"释函是","text":"寒色拥千树，寻香只一枝。\n何因重攀折，欲识树上时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45115,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五微","author":"释函是","text":"心知花在树，望月影微微。\n不到寒香入，终然此意违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45116,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六鱼","author":"释函是","text":"高树花开尽，低枝蕊尚疏。\n近人情热处，留取暗香馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45117,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七虞","author":"释函是","text":"望里花疑雪，近看一语无。\n全身在香国，顿使野情孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45118,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八齐","author":"释函是","text":"多少寒山子，相看在小溪。\n不知香冷处，终日对花迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45119,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九佳","author":"释函是","text":"有时寒雨过，生怕素香差。\n细看枝头湿，方知濯更佳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45120,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十灰","author":"释函是","text":"游人欲多折，要傍小瓶开。\n不知香在手，更觅一枝来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45121,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一真","author":"释函是","text":"花香花不觉，都付赏花人。\n人散香同岁，泠然太古春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45122,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二文","author":"释函是","text":"独立荒烟白，不惊寒雁群。\n秖因春梦断，夜夜但空闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45123,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三元","author":"释函是","text":"香暗随风度，飙飙不欲存。\n闻香意何限，花自到黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45124,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四寒","author":"释函是","text":"幽艳曾无岁，寻香人自寒。\n一般清冷致，终不悔衣单。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45125,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五删","author":"释函是","text":"独舒寒壑日，红紫一时删。\n暗香酬客意，谁会到花间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45126,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一先","author":"释函是","text":"春色有无处，但观寒腊前。\n迥临村路上，来往白云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45127,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二萧","author":"释函是","text":"觅花花不见，雨雪空萧萧。\n认得枝头稳，何须待雪消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45128,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三肴","author":"释函是","text":"秖为花开处，偏令雪上梢。\n春风吹落尽，不见雪空巢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45129,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四豪","author":"释函是","text":"走马春郊早，探花问冻醪。\n花醒人欲醉，笑杀五陵豪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45130,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五歌","author":"释函是","text":"一枝三五朵，疏处月明多。\n举头见寒月，不觉暗香过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45131,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六麻","author":"释函是","text":"日出雪消尽，泠泠一树花。\n焉知寒日落，香色未曾差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45132,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七阳","author":"释函是","text":"月下花容隐，云中花影长。\n坐到无花处，时闻一阵香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45133,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八庚","author":"释函是","text":"纵白何如雪，疏宁似竹清。\n若无香扑鼻，犹逐倚寒名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45134,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九青","author":"释函是","text":"晨起到花处，不知花已醒。\n但怜寒岁见，莫惜露零零。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45135,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十蒸","author":"释函是","text":"莫道寒偏妒，多因花欲凌。\n一自同于雪，方知雪不胜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45136,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一尤","author":"释函是","text":"薄暝易相识，月明何处愁。\n分明枯树里，望绝白云头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45137,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二侵","author":"释函是","text":"寒夜无藏处，花枝共月深。\n清光才一半，休向月中寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45138,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三覃","author":"释函是","text":"好处非关月，重烟不着岚。\n疏斜泉石里，看尽古今谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45139,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四盐","author":"释函是","text":"欲寄成何字，天涯滞尺缣。\n相思与相见，语默一时兼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45140,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五咸","author":"释函是","text":"风雪犹未已，花开自碧岩。\n欲知寒蕊意，遥指隔林杉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45141,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一东","author":"释函是","text":"色共梨花香不同，千山烟月有无中。\n立残孤影君须认，看去春林溪欲红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45142,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二冬","author":"释函是","text":"长桥低岸好相逢，多折偏怜落客踪。\n遥望白云溪路滑，几枝残雪老孤峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45143,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三江","author":"释函是","text":"翘首南天意未降，毵毵白拂竖寒窗。\n曾同黄姓同蕲路，一棹萧萧夜渡江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45144,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四支","author":"释函是","text":"洗尽铅华欲付谁，风烟凄断月明迟。\n莫愁春到先摇落，更有深春摇落时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45145,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五微","author":"释函是","text":"白玉条条映落晖，雪中春色正依违。\n天涯苦恨知何限，独立空山待客归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45146,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六鱼","author":"释函是","text":"荆榛荒没露零馀，天北天南影共疏。\n花发寒空愁更落，冰田长欲带云锄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45147,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七虞","author":"释函是","text":"昔日玄都花满衢，看花曾数暗香无。\n菟葵燕麦凋零尽，回首寒山树一株。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45148,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八齐","author":"释函是","text":"标实无期望欲迷，可怜道路独栖栖。\n谁同素影千岩秀，拨尽寒灰落紫泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45149,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九佳","author":"释函是","text":"影同寒月印空阶，错爱清光掩素怀。\n夜夜枝头看似梦，踏穷残雪惜芒鞋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45150,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十灰","author":"释函是","text":"木落烟深孤雁哀，南枝憔悴北枝催。\n从来春色应无住，空自撩人花绕台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45151,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一真","author":"释函是","text":"大汉将军六代人，披星卧雪旧风尘。\n相看灞上终何姓，忆得云中老鹤身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45152,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二文","author":"释函是","text":"成都高卧影纷纷，谁谓晴光独映文。\n放出馀香应十丈，为怜人共木樨闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45153,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三元","author":"释函是","text":"腊穷人不到柴门，花落花开总莫论。\n雪色自严香自远，更无形影待王孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45154,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四寒","author":"释函是","text":"高寄空山天地宽，素香初蕊足盘桓。\n莫将白发轻寒意，都作春愁对月看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45155,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五删","author":"释函是","text":"丁丁伐木响人间，才入春风鬓未斑。\n认取幽香付他日，腊残寒尽待花还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45156,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一先","author":"释函是","text":"为谁带雪到春前，几度相期云水边。\n过眼不堪人意尽，一枝零乱又残年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45157,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二萧","author":"释函是","text":"春光林下共迢迢，百衲云衣覆石桥。\n道是圣僧犹不似，何当香逐美人飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45158,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三肴","author":"释函是","text":"片片新花发故梢，陇头流水一间茅。\n寿阳宫里如相觅，为道于今共石巢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45159,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四豪","author":"释函是","text":"难知休讶一枝高，出手何辞待雪劳。\n花落更应期子熟，莫教人羡武陵桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45160,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五歌","author":"释函是","text":"暖处难逢寒处多，几生魂梦付藤罗。\n花光长老曾摹此，何似亲从庾岭过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45161,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六麻","author":"释函是","text":"一本分携度岭斜，只今方见岁寒花。\n山中独秀无人问，狂杀清江旧酒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45162,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七阳","author":"释函是","text":"谩道生来欲傲霜，相投应亦惜名香。\n多情共索巡檐笑，争较高眠怪石旁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45163,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八庚","author":"释函是","text":"雪满江边花气清，垂垂一树古今情。\n悲欢阅尽宣城眼，聊托诗人天下名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45164,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九青","author":"释函是","text":"蜀郡名园昼掩扃，佳人笑语尚亭亭。\n风前玉立何生梦，犹自题诗醉未醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45165,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十蒸","author":"释函是","text":"高处凭空折未能，连云带月影崚嶒。\n谁当错比仙人萼，李白亲传自老僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45166,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一尤","author":"释函是","text":"寒倚阑干映日浮，高楼胡笛满天愁。\n北风衰草蓬蓬尽，任是初年亦白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45167,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二侵","author":"释函是","text":"四望江山共一林，百年春色雪中深。\n劝君莫向枝头觅，风起隋堤何处寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45168,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三覃","author":"释函是","text":"错落云烟傍草庵，繁枝应许赤松参。\n春风暖处如相忆，数尽霜中一月谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45169,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四盐","author":"释函是","text":"万汇凋伤花意严，烟漫漫又月纤纤。\n传闻胜似吴门见，名姓终惭薄世嫌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45170,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五咸","author":"释函是","text":"颗颗骊珠月欲函，洛阳归去寄松杉。\n幽花不作凌霜色，万古香风自一岩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45171,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一东","author":"释函是","text":"二月岭南雪，梨花间雪中。\n影浮难似月，力弱不关风。\n片上青衫色，繁飘白浪空。\n千峰今夜梦，迢递湿归鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45172,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二冬","author":"释函是","text":"春泥看易尽，空谷自为容。\n覆叶深藏鸟，繁花不惹蜂。\n暖沈朝市影，冻塞虎狼踪。\n渐见蓬蒿满，川原何处逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45173,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三江","author":"释函是","text":"停舟烟树白，沽酒对寒江。\n古驿无嘶马，孤村有吠尨。\n近坟埋土垒，远火暗山窗。\n谁复能同此，栖芦雁一双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45174,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四支","author":"释函是","text":"龙山惊险峻，云路慎挤推。\n压颓愁地轴，飘落念天涯。\n低易填沟壑，高多折干枝。\n看穷残腊景，茅屋欲深移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45175,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五微","author":"释函是","text":"阴景去何促，阳和转尚微。\n若将虚夜色，无复拟朝晖。\n热处终难待，寒中初易违。\n且寻峰顶侣，云雾共相依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45176,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六鱼","author":"释函是","text":"却似云中日，朦胧曙色初。\n耐寒兴独早，爱暖步还纡。\n筛岭树边犊，迷江榜上鱼。\n何人重回首，凄断老樵渔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45177,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七虞","author":"释函是","text":"弥天光共满，薄景照偏殊。\n关塞愁征戍，屋庐凄腐儒。\n湿吹连晓角，寒断一冬须。\n莫以千峰色，都同暗夜珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45178,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八齐","author":"释函是","text":"峰峻疑悬布，玲珑逼汉低。\n徘徊惊晓鹤，呃喔误宵鸡。\n竹摧阴壑影，猿断北山啼。\n沃土候春暖，携锄分夜畦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45179,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九佳","author":"释函是","text":"启户皑皑积，观林密密排。\n冥茫应自合，纬繣不成乖。\n带露胎春雨，连云泽冻荄。\n氛埃消欲尽，冷艳此时谐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45180,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十灰","author":"释函是","text":"高低看落处，淅沥竟何来。\n积坎非邀厚，知危不受摧。\n借晖分鹭翅，倚素入琼杯。\n千里何辞远，层峦夕曜开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45181,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一真","author":"释函是","text":"暖席不堪近，寒溪好作邻。\n岂嫌青草陌，欲傍白头人。\n隐雾迷深谷，乘风度远津。\n年年似荒月，来照不萌春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45182,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二文","author":"释函是","text":"阴结先成霰，萧萧自远闻。\n入山青易见，到水白难分。\n惜暗夜笼月，停光昼薄云。\n晴檐澌欲滴，宿鸟啄微昕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45183,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十三元","author":"释函是","text":"寒波汎不极，琼路易迷源。\n积曜夕沈壑，微光晓在门。\n遮空时欲下，舞屑忽成繁。\n深谷无炎热，层冰岂自存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45184,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十四寒","author":"释函是","text":"一夜鸟飞绝，千峰影到栏。\n莫将银世界，空作月明看。\n对尔皆怜白，何人不畏寒。\n浮云满原隰，遮莫悔衣单。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45185,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五删","author":"释函是","text":"朔风不到海，寒气早归山。\n玉露当秋委，琼花向暮斓。\n洁堪窥汉净，轻得御云间。\n幽望成何似，皋禽断续还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45186,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"一先","author":"释函是","text":"通胧光瞩地，浩荡渺连天。\n照岂分高下，污从落市廛。\n年华休见晚，晓气欲争先。\n不待阳和动，微风散玉泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45187,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二箫","author":"释函是","text":"惨冽纷晨影，凝华冻晚飙。\n连光摇暖幌，含曜落寒潮。\n不借投虚隙，何劳映碧霄。\n一回幽对暇，寥廓静尘嚣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45188,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三肴","author":"释函是","text":"薄照掩寒日，渔舟冻欲胶。\n大江沈远岫，枯树覆空巢。\n鼯鼠归无路，云僧盖有茅。\n莫愁纷糅下，千地一深坳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45189,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]